    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">International X-Ray Interdiction Training</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">The objective of this course is to train user and technician level personnel in the effective use of x-ray systems so that they can more effectively target, locate and interdict contraband. The course explains and demonstrates the differences in current x-ray systems and the most effective uses of each in identifying anomalies.</narrative>
    </description>
